WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:14.878
It’s project time! Write rules that make art: use nested loops to build patterns from shapes, controlled randomness so every run is different, and explain your rules in an artist statement.

2
00:00:15.478 --> 00:00:20.626
Generative artists write rules, and the computer makes the art.

3
00:00:20.626 --> 00:00:24.035
Randomness means every run is different.

4
00:00:24.635 --> 00:00:35.435
A loop inside a loop: the inner loop draws a shape, the outer loop repeats it with a turn to make a rosette.

5
00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:45.096
Use pick random for colour, position or size — but keep some rules fixed so it still looks designed.

6
00:00:45.696 --> 00:00:49.104
Real generative artists explain their rules.

7
00:00:49.104 --> 00:00:52.948
Write which rules you chose and why.

8
00:00:53.548 --> 00:00:57.391
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

9
00:00:57.391 --> 00:01:02.539
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
